        "title": "Bushfire survivor builds fire-resistant tiny home kit that fits in ute",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/215100/Bushfire-survivor-builds-fire-resistant-tiny-home-kit-that-fits-in-ute",
        "content_text": "Bushfire survivor builds fire-resistant tiny home kit that fits in ute tray (a ute is a two seater vehicle with a cargo tray.)\n\n<a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-09-18/fire-resistant-tiny-home-casa-manyana/107157308\">Architect Adriano Pupilli creates a flat-packed tiny home that meets the second-highest bushfire attack level after enduring the 2019 Black Summer bushfires.</a>",
