        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/leak-reveals-details-for-more-iphone-18-models-launching-early-2027/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/12/iphone-17-black.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/09/no-iphone-18-announced-today-heres-why/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1067979\">rumored</a> to have three new iPhone models launching in early 2027: iPhone 18, iPhone 18e, and iPhone Air 2. Here’s what to expect from the iPhone 18 models per the latest leak.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-18\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077972\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/leak-reveals-details-for-more-iphone-18-models-launching-early-2027/#more-1077972\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
