        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/apple-tv-renews-knife-edge-chasing-michelin-stars-for-season-three/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/knife-edge.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Award-winning culinary show ‘<a href=\"https://apple.co/48yxyiC\">Knife Edge: Chasing Michelin Stars</a>’ is getting a third season, in an announcement that came hours after its second season came to a close. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077805\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/apple-tv-renews-knife-edge-chasing-michelin-stars-for-season-three/#more-1077805\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
