        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/05/apple-releases-first-ios-27-3-public-beta-with-redesigned-health-app-and-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/iOS-27.3-public.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has released the first iOS 27.3 public beta for iPhone. The update brings back the redesigned Health app that briefly appeared during iOS 27.2 testing. It also adds vertical tabs in Safari, gives Siri AI more to do across Apple’s apps, and makes the iPhone Duo easier to use with one hand.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077434\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/05/apple-releases-first-ios-27-3-public-beta-with-redesigned-health-app-and-more/#more-1077434\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
