        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/claude-personal-finance.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Having the right context is what makes AI tools useful. Anthropic just launched the ability to securely use personal finance data with Claude. The company emphasizes that the feature is read-only and can’t take financial actions.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,apps,claude\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077634\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/05/anthropic-upgrades-claude-with-new-personal-finance-feature/#more-1077634\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
