        "title": "Apple TV reportedly getting Justin Timberlake docuseries, announces new Toni Collette show",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/04/apple-tv-reportedly-getting-justin-timberlake-docuseries-announces-new-toni-collette-show/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/11/apple-tv-new-logo-large.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With one official announcement and one report, two new Apple TV projects have been revealed this week. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077485\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/04/apple-tv-reportedly-getting-justin-timberlake-docuseries-announces-new-toni-collette-show/#more-1077485\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
