        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-new-knowledge-artifacts-of-the-ai-economy/",
        "content_text": "At our recent Foo Camp, a number of people said something like, “I don’t want someone else’s code any more. I may have my agent take a look at it, but I want to extract just the parts that I want, and may rewrite even those in Rust. It’s just too easy to create just [&#8230;]",
