        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/what-it-takes-to-trust-automatic-model-routing/",
        "content_text": "When a new coding model comes out, I want to try it. New releases always carry a promise for me. Maybe it can handle a change that needed too much manual intervention before. Maybe it can find the problem an earlier model kept missing. Maybe it can handle some coding scenarios that my favorite model [&#8230;]",
