        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/who-governs-what-an-agent-learns/",
        "content_text": "The following article originally appeared on Tim O’Brien’s Medium blog and is being republished here with the author’s permission. I think we’re missing something in the conversation about agent security. We keep asking whether an agent has the right “identity” and “credentials.” Whether its credentials expire fast enough. Whether it can access a database or [&#8230;]",
